    <item>
      <title>Can the AI Boom Survive a Margin Squeeze?</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-26/can-the-ai-boom-survive-a-margin-squeeze-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9accc4d126289f9fc1511ba8</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:07:45 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>In this episode of Merryn Talks Money, Merryn Somerset Webb and Steve Hou, head of research at Silicon Data, delve into an emerging issue in the economics of artificial intelligence: token prices are falling while the cost of compute needed to produce them is rising. They discuss what this mismatch could mean for the valuations of companies like OpenAI and Anthropic, whether demand can justify the enormous sums being invested in AI infrastructure and what happens when everyone has armies of AI agents working on our behalf. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
